{"id":"00009","root":"uni00009_1","name":{"ja":"ふうま　天音","en":"Fuuma Amane"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ふうま　天音","en":"Fuuma Amane"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":9,"profile":{"ja":"ふうま家に仕える執事。ふうま一門の由緒正しい家系で、小太郎の親戚にあたる。強力な邪眼故、幼い頃から戦場に駆り出され苛烈な幼少時代を過ごす。彼女の父、権正は彼女を恐れ疎んじたが弾正は彼女の強さに惚れこみ、歪んだ愛情によって戦闘マシーンに育てあげたという。知略にも優れ、普段は組織運用を主な仕事としているが、弾正が危機に瀕した時、彼女の出番となる。弾正と同様、米連のサイボーグ化手術を受けており、左手がサイボーグアームである。このサイボーグアームは彼女の能力と連動する特殊なもので、彼女が蓄積したエネルギーをサイボーグアームの掌にある孔からエネルギー弾として放つ事が出来る。ふうま小太郎と出会い、協力するとともに小太郎の執事を務めたがり、時子との衝突をすることもしばしば。","en":"Fuuma Amane serves as a butler to the Fuuma household. She hails from a distinguished branch of the Fuuma clan and is a relative of Kotaro. Because of her powerful evil eye, she was thrust onto battlefields from a young age, enduring a harsh childhood. Her father, Gōshō, feared and despised her, but Danjo fell in love with her strength and, out of a twisted affection, raised her into a combat machine. Skilled in strategy, she normally handles organizational duties, but steps into the front lines when Danjo is in crisis. Like Danjo, she underwent the United States' cybernetic surgery, giving her a cybernetic left arm. This arm is specially linked to her abilities, allowing her to fire energy projectiles from a palm-mounted aperture after storing energy. After meeting Kotaro, she chose to cooperate and serve as his butler, often clashing with Tokiko."},"illustrator":"新堂エル","voiceActor":"一ノ瀬さくら","forms":[{"id":"uni00009_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1320,2647],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[135,270],"def":[147,295],"spd":[48,48],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","30"]},{"id":"uni00009_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2040,4083],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[195,391],"def":[219,438],"spd":[48,48],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","30","31"]},{"id":"uni00009_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabe